  "description": "Who would ever believe a cat could talk? All I did was vent a little frustration to a stray cat on the street, but then...\n\n\\[This is a reward reserved only for kind humans! Quick, tell me! Is that your wish, meow?\\]\n\n *\"I mean, if it were me, I would’ve done it like this! I would’ve...!\"*\n\n\\[Done! I shall grant your wish, meow!\\]\n\nSuddenly, I’ve been transmigrated into my favorite novel—ten years after its ending! But since I’m here, I might as well live happily ever after with my \"bias\"! Will she be able to claim her happy ending?\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Sunjeong Danpyeonseon (순정 단편선) Collection.*",
